Wait, if `_impartial(self.call)` is a class, then `inspect.isgeneratorfunction(_impartial(self.call))` will be `False`. So it will proceed to check `dunder_call`.

If I add `if inspect.isclass(_impartial(self.call)): return False` after the first `if` block, it should work.

